<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ share market closes stronger on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>NZ share market closes stronger on Wednesday.</headline>
<text>
<p>* NZ share market closes firmer</p>
<p>* Telecom puts in another strong performance</p>
<p>* Fletcher letter stocks show good gains ----------------------------(JUN 18)----------------------------</p>
<p>Price movements at close</p>
<p>	    LAST CHG  * NZSE40 cap index +32.18 at 2,400.21</p>
<p>	    138   +1  * NZSE-10 cap index +20.78 at 1,213.39</p>
<p>	    3.55  +6  * NZSC cap index +0.25 at 5,106.37</p>
<p>	    3.44  +6  * NZMC cap index +6.46 at 1,892.62</p>
<p>	    3.72  +3  * Volume NZ$61.3 million.</p>
<p>     * Futures +12 at 1,205 7.34  +15</p>
<p>     * Other movers- -10 +6</p>
</text>
